| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [GO-TEST-0001](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-TEST-0001 "Panic on malformed language tag in golang.org/x/text") | golang.org/x/text@v0.3.5 → v0.3.8 | v0.3.7 | main.go:10:28 iter.main → language.Parse |
| [GO-TEST-0002](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-TEST-0002 "Denial of service in golang.org/x/text") | golang.org/x/text@v0.3.7 → v0.3.8 | v0.3.8 | main.go:10:28 iter.main → language.Parse |
